1
00:00:00,250 --> 00:00:02,542
Thanks for shopping at Freshway. Have a nice day!

2
00:00:03,850 --> 00:00:04,725
Cool costume, mister!

3
00:00:06,050 --> 00:00:10,421
Attention shoppers. Please remain calm, and enjoy your shopping.

4
00:00:10,971 --> 00:00:12,971
Ha! Raccoon in a hat.

5
00:00:13,521 --> 00:00:16,747
Mimi says stay calm. I'm calm. I'm the calmest guy here.

6
00:00:17,297 --> 00:00:17,672
Hello?

7
00:00:19,097 --> 00:00:21,026
See? Nothing. Everything's fine.

8
00:00:21,897 --> 00:00:22,272
Hello?

9
00:00:26,097 --> 00:00:26,630
AAAAAAAAH!

10
00:00:30,097 --> 00:00:32,663
Gus! Don't run! They can smell it!

11
00:00:32,943 --> 00:00:33,954
Smell WHAT?!

12
00:00:34,504 --> 00:00:36,612
Look at me. Breathe in for four.

13
00:00:36,892 --> 00:00:37,950
I can't, I can't!

14
00:00:38,230 --> 00:00:40,185
Smile. Like it's your first day.

15
00:00:45,135 --> 00:00:48,163
Fascinating. They don't hunt people. They hunt fear.

16
00:00:48,735 --> 00:00:55,945
Rule one: fear is a target. Rule two: calm is invisible. Rule three: no running.

17
00:00:56,595 --> 00:00:57,342
Is this a game?

18
00:00:57,622 --> 00:00:58,409
He's walking through them!

19
00:00:58,689 --> 00:01:00,580
He doesn't know he should be scared.

20
00:01:01,595 --> 00:01:02,945
How are you so calm?

21
00:01:03,225 --> 00:01:04,935
Six years of customer service.

22
00:01:05,485 --> 00:01:07,158
Please! Somebody help us!

23
00:01:11,285 --> 00:01:13,220
Please... remain calm.

24
00:01:14,085 --> 00:01:14,874
Have a nice day.
